However packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts still wires production inference through createModelCall(ctx), and packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/model-call.ts resolves every lane through ctx.modelRegistry.find(provider, model). The added proof in packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/startup-validation.test.ts constructs a mock modelRegistry containing that exact lane; it does not prove PI's real production registry contains `openai-codex/gpt-5.4-mini`.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"SV-003\",\n      \"status\": \"resolved\",\n      \"rationale\": \"packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/startup-validation.ts now emits unreachable-lane reports through a headless channel when ctx.hasUI is false: report() calls an injected headlessLog or defaultHeadlessLog, and defaultHeadlessLog writes to stderr with writeSync(2, ...). packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/startup-validation.test.ts verifies the injected headlessLog receives the formatted unreachable-lane message, while health persistence remains covered.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"newFindings\": [],\n  \"openFindings\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"SV-001\",\n      \"severity\": \"major\",\n      \"title\": \"Shipped default lane is still not proven production-reachable\",\n      \"evidence\": \"packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/model-call.ts defines DEFAULT_PI_MODEL as `{ provider: \\\"openai-codex\\\", id: \\\"gpt-5.4-mini\\\" }`, and direct proof from loadAssignments(undefined).smoothed_prompt returned `{provider:\\\"openai-codex\\\",model:\\\"gpt-5.4-mini\\\",prompt:\\\"smoothing-v1\\\"}`. The production path in packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts still uses createModelCall(ctx), and packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/model-call.ts resolves assignments through ctx.modelRegistry.find(provider, model). The test evidence in packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/startup-validation.test.ts proves only that a mocked registry containing `openai-codex/gpt-5.4-mini` validates successfully; no code, artifact, or external registry proof establishes that PI's real production modelRegistry contains this lane.\",\n      \"affectedFiles\": [\n        \"packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/model-call.ts\",\n        \"packages/pi-lhc/src/inference/assignments.ts\",\n        \"packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts\",\n        \"packages/pi-lhc/test/inference/startup-validation.test.ts\"\n      ],\n      \"requirementIds\": [\n        \"AC-5.4\",\n        \"TC-5.4\",\n        \"Real-Code Workaround Standard\"\n      ],\n      \"recommendedFixScope\": \"same-session-implementor\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \"requirementCoverage\": {\n    \"verified\": [\n      \"AC-5.1: startup validation probes configured lanes through modelRegistry.find and hasConfiguredAuth\",\n      \"AC-5.2 / TC-5.2: unreachable-lane reports now reach UI mode and headless stderr/log channel, and persist to health\",\n      \"AC-5.3 / TC-5.3: affected derivation failure classification/queryability remained covered by current startup-validation tests\",\n      \"AC-5.5 / TC-5.6: malformed placeholders and unknown assignment keys fail loud\",\n      \"Story Gate: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify passed\",\n      \"Epic Gate: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all passed\"\n    ],\n    \"unverified\": [\n      \"AC-5.4 / TC-5.4: shipped default assignments are not proven to target a real production-reachable PI modelRegistry lane\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"gatesRun\": [\n    {\n      \"command\": \"pnpm --filter pi-lhc exec vitest run test/inference/assignments.test.ts test/inference/startup-validation.test.ts\",\n      \"result\": \"pass\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"command\": \"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify\",\n      \"result\": \"pass\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"command\": \"pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all\",\n      \"result\": \"pass\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"productionPathFindings\": [\n    \"Default assignments now use `openai-codex/gpt-5.4-mini`, but the production createModelCall(ctx) path still depends on PI ctx.modelRegistry.find(provider, model), and the current evidence only proves that a mocked registry accepts this lane.\"\n  ],\n  \"recommendedNextStep\": \"revise\",\n  \"recommendedFixScope\": \"same-session-implementor\",\n  \"openQuestions\": [],\n  \"additionalObservations\": [\n    \"No material fake adapter, shim, or placeholder branch was found in the fixed headless reporting path; stderr emission is real runtime behavior.\",\n    \"Configured gates passed, but gate success does not close the missing proof point for the default PI registry lane.\"\n  ]\n}"}}
